# Data Property: <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000251> (has type)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000251> "has type"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000251> "Indicates the type of algorithm parameter value, such as, for example, xsd:double for 'absolute tolerance'."@en)
FunctionalDataProperty(<http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000251>)
DataPropertyDomain(<http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000251> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000201>)

# Data Property: <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000275> (has Runge-Kutta method order)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000275> "has Runge-Kutta method order"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000275> "Indicates the order of a 'Runge-Kutta based method' [urn.miriam.biomodels.kisao:KISAO_0000064]. A 'Runge-Kutta based method' has order p if for sufficiently smooth initial value problems (y'=f(x,y), y(x0)=y0),  ||y(x0 + h)-y1||<=Kh^(p+h)."@en)
DataPropertyDomain(<http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000275> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000064>)
DataPropertyRange(<http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000275> xsd:int)



