AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000094> "Livermore solver"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000094> "Method to solve ordinary differential equations developed at the Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory."@en)
SubClassOf(<http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000094> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000694>)
