AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000097> "AZ"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#isOrganizational> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000097> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000097> "modelling and simulation algorithm characteristic"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000097> "modeling and simulation algorithm characteristic"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000097> "Simulation algorithm property, which can, for example, describe the model, such as the type of variables (discrete or continuous), and information on the treatment of spatial descriptions, or can be a numerical characteristic, such as the system's behaviour (deterministic or stochastic) as well as the progression mechanism (fixed or adaptive time steps)."@en)

