AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000437> "2012-11-29"^^xsd:date)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000437> "AZ"@en)
