# Class: <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000491> (discrete event simulation algorithm)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000491> "discrete event simulation algorithm"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "C.G. Cassandras & S. Lafortune \"Introduction to Discrete Event Systems\", Chapt 1 2nd Ed 2008. Springer"@en) rdfs:seeAlso <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000491> "http://identifiers.org/isbn/0387333320"^^xsd:anyURI)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000491> "DES"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000491> "Discrete Event Simulation algorithm refers to the simulation of systems whose (countable) discrete states change over time and are event-driven."@en)
SubClassOf(<http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000491> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000000>)
