AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000498> "number of runs"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000498> "The number of runs that a simulation should perform. Typically used to specify the number of runs for a stochastic simulation."@en)
SubClassOf(<http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000498> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000201>)

# Class: <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000499> (dynamic flux balance analysis)

