AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000519> "The parameter is a positive integer value to determine the size of the population, i.e., the number of individuals that survive after each generation."@en)
