AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000520> "evolutionary algorithm"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000520> "An optimisation algorithm that mimics evolution and is based on reproduction and selection."@en)
