# Class: <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000575> (hybrid tau-leaping method)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000575> "2020-11-06"^^xsd:date)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000575> "BD"@en)
