AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000593> "minimization of metabolic adjustment (MOMA) is an extension of FBA for the prediction of flux distributions in gene knockouts. MOMA identifies the closest point in the permissible flux space of the knockout to the wild-type flux vector by solving an optimization problem."@en)
