CVODE is used for ordinary differential equation (ODE) systems. IDA is used for differential-algebraic equation (DAE) systems."@en)
SubClassOf(<http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000617> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000352>)

# Class: <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000618> (bunker)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000618> "2021-01-30"^^xsd:date)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000618> "JRK"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "iBioSim"@en) <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#isImplementedIn> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000618> "http://identifiers.org/biosimulators/ibiosim"^^xsd:anyURI)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000618> "bunker"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000618> "A variant of the stochastic simulation algorithm (SSA) in which the time to the next reaction is equated to the mean inter-event time (inverse of the sum of the propensitites of the reactions) rather than sampled from a distribution parameterized by this mean inter-event time. In this method, the next reaction time is deterministic rather than stochastic as in SSA."@en)
SubClassOf(<http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000618> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000335>)

# Class: <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000619> (emc-sim)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000619> "2021-01-30"^^xsd:date)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000619> "JRK"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(rdfs:comment "iBioSim"@en) <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#isImplementedIn> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000619> "http://identifiers.org/biosimulators/ibiosim"^^xsd:anyURI)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000619> "emc-sim"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000619> "A variant of the stochastic simulation algorithm (SSA) in which the time to the next reaction is a constant equal to 1 time unit. In this method, the next reaction time is deterministic rather than stochastic as in SSA."@en)
SubClassOf(<http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000619> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000335>)

