AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000620> "pFBA"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <http://www.biomodels.net/kisao/KISAO#KISAO_0000620> "A technique for selecting a flux distribution which is parsimonious by some metric, such as a solution which has the minimal number of active fluxes or a solution which has the smallest sum of active fluxes."@en)
